ly:Georgia;\">The steps involved in ResNet18 transfer learning are as follows:\n","\n","<li>Load the pre-trained ResNet18 model: The first step is to load the pre-trained ResNet18 model, which can be easily done using popular deep learning frameworks such as PyTorch or TensorFlow.\n","\n","<li>Replace the final fully connected layer: The final layer of the pre-trained ResNet18 model is a fully connected layer with 1000 output neurons corresponding to the number of classes in ImageNet. This layer needs to be replaced with a new fully connected layer with the number of output neurons equal to the number of classes in the new dataset.\n","\n","<li>Freeze the pre-trained layers: The weights of the pre-trained layers are frozen so that only the weights of the new fully connected layer are updated during training. This ensures that the learned features from the pre-trained model are preserved and only the classification layer is adapted to the new task.\n","\n","<li>Prepare the new dataset: The new dataset needs to be prepared by splitting it into training, validation, and test sets and resizing the images to the required input size of the pre-trained ResNet18 model.\n","\n","<li>Train the model: The model is trained on the new dataset with a small learning rate, allowing the weights of the new fully connected layer to be updated gradually while preserving the learned features of the pre-trained layers.\n","\n","<li>Evaluate the model: The performance of the fine-tuned ResNet18 model is evaluated on the test set to measure its accuracy and other performance metrics.\n","    \n","<p style=\"font-family:Georgia;\">While using the learnt features from the pre-trained model, ResNet18 transfer learning can significantly minimise the quantity of training data and time needed to construct a high-performing model for a new task. It is a potent method that has demonstrated success in a range of computer vision applications, including segmentation, object identification, and picture classification."]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"metadata":{"id":"FvUW4Krhoz-U"},"outputs":[],"source":["freeze_to(resnet18pre_train, -1, True)"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/","height":679,"referenced_widgets":["bbbc2aa5e46a440f88adc3849fe98ea6","bebb947dfc7d40a5b89ba1183855673c","4671b16c229d43bd81e1da7892f14abc","c7041adcb2a446e3a48819ebda8bac2a","493cec95b38e40b9b9900dd08da05614","09671b8b75b041eba628c8f9f84cc4a8","1bf52587797f47479d969059aa62665c","96a3ce3849d5438fa198190660e9094c","e0abe8c35f07499fb7cadffecf4dbf96","a94930f851fe423e84da22a011a97a51","1f7cae7b7c824d93a488737759f08f2c","35fcb90c2a184bd297a41e88562622d3","341178ee886847cba4f968ff0e6f9af2","ddfa0a35855d4758952806c038371e3c","d720bd1fbd144beb9973996072fa5715","5308849920a64898a512f188b62641b6","780a9ee2382546f7931dc5595c9eceeb","1a2e0cdd0f2240e9aeaff86cc5aa5240","fddce8adf8184d629b4caad9383de6bd","0293753e25914d6e8b1e0606829cb0fc","7573f31e9c114f9ea786f58a8717f611","5ef31c3710c8444c84293de74601ca6b","2bb156f51e25452bb3dc9511ef8887bd","6e52158c2506494a9bd0814534c40aab","a3c46273b609449cba2dfc3d9415b682","ca611afd86e642f3ac9ac2560ea3af0b","3a269a3ae2684634a5607e20835a18ed","23b852beb6e44358955fc06127136e9f","ba1c6a504cdb49e192b39002bb89ca66","7863d9fea3af4974a2daa0c94f0e4abc","95eb5e62ded64e36aa4b748157b0e836","1c72f692444646d4ae5e14d63676f8f1","958f60af76dc4ec59863dc1e0aa59359","e6b6b2162e7c45269a45538ec9413329","4bbc17eb919f477ebbf5c67b228ac89b","7a70186c9e6a4822826cb77d43357ae5","6e96282eb2484c3b8cf66d7d7ab0085e","59cc59928b3c4168a193e780fa8eedf4","0f8ecc8719ed4201b5bdca11b11dd092","a1bd98ac086c447ba55750942f9dea44","01a2dc33d4654b51992abc635f9eb132","7904299cb1d841949f40f407d050c117","9099283eef2247888e6085d07666392c","513587b4f7b5423f8a463ce673bb4b46","67aa76b2525c479f8f956ee1b5365388","938c110cf29c4313889b236dd1c8fed9","c6b2c6802e3a479a8e80617d4bc2ad7c","92653c7027cf4510b3e78ae5c264acaa","4d46142cfa484b929dfa